<title>USA: Simon DeBartolo Group completes offering.</title>
<headline>Simon DeBartolo Group completes offering.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon DeBartolo Group Inc said Tuesday it has completed its public offering of 8 million shares of 8-3/4 percent Series B cumulative redeemable preferred stock at $25 a share.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the offering will be used to repay existing debt, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
